WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Li Jae-myung! Li Jae-myung!

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
These voters in Seoul show their support for the Democratic Party candidate Li Jae-myung,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
or rather for his artificial intelligence look-alike.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
This is a campaign video like no other.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Li's message to voters is not being given by the man himself,

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.160
but by a digital clone in a first for a South Korean election.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:34.260
At first, people think he's the real Lee.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:37.480
They say, you mean it's not Lee, it's created by technology?

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.100
They find it difficult to believe.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:44.100
Yoon, the real-life version, is out on the streets drumming up support

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:48.380
for his party's candidate, Lee, who's in a tight race with Yoon Suk-yeol

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.360
of the Conservative People Power Party,

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:54.640
at the climax of a campaign affected by COVID-19 restrictions.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:01:04.800
Lee is unable to personally visit every region, but thanks to AI, his deepfake can go anywhere

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:12.780
and adapt his approach in each of the 226 constituencies.

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:16.540
Technology developed by South Korean firms is helping them connect with traditionally

00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:21.880
marginalized groups, including people with disabilities and those living in far-flung

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:23.880
parts of the country.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:30.880
The audience is the AI-2022 candidate for the US-22 candidate.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:32.880
The candidate is the same.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.880
One version is more casual, the other, more formal.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:41.880
These digital personas not only switch their outfits to suit their audience,

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.880
they can also respond to every minor change,

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:47.880
including the type of voter who support their seeking,

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:51.880
and they have a striking resemblance to their human originals.

00:01:51.880 --> 00:02:00.000
I learned that many people think that this AI version is a real person.
